  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A Future that Works Program (AFW) - Philippines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &#x2018;A Future that Works&#x2019; Program seeks to enhance Philippine workforce development and industry competitiveness by fostering greater collaboration among industry leaders and with relevant government agencies. Leveraging Australia&#x2019;s experience and  relevant global models, the program aims to address the challenges and opportunities of the &#x2018;Fourth Industrial Revolution&#x2019; (4IR) in sectors particularly vulnerable to technological disruption. It supports the creation of Sector Skills Councils, which provide data-driven insights into labour market needs to inform government policies and programs, thereby addressing job-skills mismatches and promoting digitalisation.</narrative>
  </description>
